{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39109","headline":"对雪献薛常侍 · 韦庄","name":"对雪献薛常侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"璚林瑶树忽珊珊，急带西风下晚天。\n皓鹤䙰褷飞不辨，玉山重叠冻相连。\n松装粉穗临窗亚，水结冰锥簇溜悬。\n门外寒光利如劒，莫推红袖诉金船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39109.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39109","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}